{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NyLCH5JHzjP77JDQ7H1UVj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-13-1430-batch-mle-main-ptrs-upload\n2\t\n3\tReplace per-trace `main_ptrs.to_device()` calls in MLE sumcheck rounds with a single batched device upload per round. Currently, each MLE round iterates over ~310 traces (at APC 300) and calls `main_ptrs.to_device()` individually, issuing a separate `cudaMallocAsync` + `cudaMemcpyAsync` for a tiny buffer (~16-48 bytes) per trace. Across all rounds and segments, this totals ~3000-4000 unnecessary allocation+copy+free triplets, each also acquiring the global `MEMORY_MANAGER` mutex. Consolidating all per-round main_ptrs into a single flat vector and uploading once eliminates this overhead, saving an estimated 20-40ms from the 170ms MLE Rounds span at APC 300.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2fb024d-582e-4612-82c1-d7c12af7ab35","uuid":"5e122c9b-ec4b-4823-8c24-b6a04c6583f2","timestamp":"2026-04-13T10:02:10.431Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-13-1430-batch-mle-main-ptrs-upload\n\nReplace per-trace `main_ptrs.to_device()` calls in MLE sumcheck rounds with a single batched device upload per round. Currently, each MLE round iterates over ~310 traces (at APC 300) and calls `main_ptrs.to_device()` individually, issuing a separate `cudaMallocAsync` + `cudaMemcpyAsync` for a tiny buffer (~16-48 bytes) per trace. Across all rounds and segments, this totals ~3000-4000 unnecessary allocation+copy+free triplets, each also acquiring the global `MEMORY_MANAGER` mutex. Consolidating all per-round main_ptrs into a single flat vector and uploading once eliminates this overhead, saving an estimated 20-40ms from the 170ms MLE Rounds span at APC 300.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
