cess one AIR:\n```rust\nstruct Round0AirWorkItem<'a, HS: GpuHashScheme> {\n    trace_idx: usize,\n    single_pk: &'a DeviceStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,  // Single AIR's proving key\n    n: isize,                                                       // Lift parameter for domain size\n    selectors_cube: &'a DeviceMatrix<F>,                           // 3D selectors matrix\n    public_values: &'a DeviceBuffer<F>,                            // Per-AIR public values\n    eq_3bs: &'a [EF],                                              // Interaction eq evaluations\n    cached_mains: &'a [CommittedTraceData<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>], // Multiple trace parts\n    common_main: &'a DeviceMatrix<F>,                              // Common main trace\n    eq_xis: &'a FxHashMap<usize, EqEvalLayers<EF>>,               // Precomputed eq(x_i) for all i\n    d_lambda_pows: &'a DeviceBuffer<EF>,                           // Lambda challenge powers\n    beta_pows: &'a [EF],                                           // Beta challenge powers\n    l_skip: usize,                                                  // Skip domain log2\n    constraint_degree: usize,                                       // Global max constraint degree\n    xi: &'a [EF],                                                  // Challenge vector\n    max_temp_bytes: usize,                                          // Per-thread temp memory budget\n}\n```\n\n**Main Orchestration (Lines 897-966):**\n\nThe function `prove_zerocheck_and_logup_gpu` (starting line 276) contains the Round 0 evaluation orchestration:\n\n**Phase 1: Build Work Items (Lines 899-926)**\n- **Line 900:** `let per_thread_temp_bytes = self.memory_limit_bytes / NUM_ROUND0_STREAMS.max(1);` — Divides total memory budget equally across threads\n- **Lines 901-926:** Creates `Vec<Round0AirWorkItem>` by zipping together trace-by-trace metadata (one item per AIR)\n- **Line 929:** Work items are **sorted by descending height** for load balancing acros