r with capacity from `_zerocheck_r0_intermediates_buffer_size()`\n3. **Lines 70-80:** Allocates temp sums buffer with capacity from `_zerocheck_r0_temp_sums_buffer_size()`\n4. **Lines 89-93:** Extracts preprocessed trace pointer (if exists)\n5. **Lines 95-96:** Allocates output sumcheck evaluation buffer: `num_cosets * skip_domain` elements\n6. **Lines 100-121:** **Launches kernel** `zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints()` — unsafe FFI call to CUDA\n7. **Line 123:** Returns evaluated buffer\n\n**Buffers allocated per-AIR:**\n- `intermediates`: Layout `[buffer_size][num_threads][NUM_COSETS]` (only if `buffer_size > 16`)\n- `temp_sums_buffer`: Layout `[num_blocks][NUM_COSETS * skip_domain]`\n- `sp_evals`: Output buffer of size `num_cosets * skip_domain` (in `EF` elements)\n\n#### Function: `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu`\n\n**Lines 132-147: Signature**\n```rust\npub fn evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    pk: &DeviceStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n    symbolic: &SymbolicConstraints<F>,           // Interaction symbolic constraints\n    selectors_cube: &DeviceBuffer<F>,\n    main_parts: &DeviceBuffer<*const F>,\n    public_values: &DeviceBuffer<F>,\n    eq_cube: *const EF,\n    beta_pows: &[EF],                            // Beta challenge powers (for message fields)\n    eq_3bs: &[EF],                               // Per-interaction eq(3b) evaluations\n    skip_domain: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    height: u32,\n    num_cosets: u32,                             // constraint_degree (note: not -1)\n    g_shift: F,\n    max_temp_bytes: usize,\n) -> Result<DeviceBuffer<Frac<EF>>, Round0EvalError>\n```\n\n**What it does (Lines 148-275):**\n1. **Lines 148-151:** Returns empty buffer if no interactions\n2. **Lines 154-207:** Builds a synthetic \"interactions DAG\" where:\n   - Creates a new DAG with interaction count + message field expressions as constraints\n   - Computes `numer_weights` and `denom_weights` for each rule index (weighted by `eq_3bs`