{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JsypjhQ8A5CBfue8SRkJdR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Performance Summary\n\n**Current state at APC 300 (STARK excl trace: 1409ms, 1.74x vs baseline 2455ms):**\n\n| Component | APC 0 | APC 300 | APC 0→300 Scaling |\n|-----------|-------|---------|------------------|\n| Round 0 | 177ms | 294ms | **0.60x (WORSE!)** |\n| MLE Rounds | 114ms | 169ms | **0.67x (WORSE!)** |\n| LogUp GKR | 1026ms | 518ms | 1.98x |\n| Trace Commit | 532ms | 246ms | 2.16x |\n| WHIR | 217ms | 101ms | 2.15x |\n| Stacked Reduction | 76ms | 74ms | **1.03x (FLAT)** |\n\n**Goal**: APC 300 STARK excl trace ≤ 1078ms (for >2x ratio with APC 0's 2157ms).\n\n**Root cause of Round 0's poor scaling**: At APC 300, each of the ~310 AIRs per segment gets individual kernel launches (2+ per AIR), buffer allocations, and H2D copies. Per-AIR overhead dominates GPU kernel execution: nsys shows ~564ms total GPU kernel time processed across 8 threads giving 294ms wall time, but ideal parallelism would yield ~30ms — meaning **76% of Round 0 time is overhead**, not compute.\n\n## Optimization Ideas\n\n**Idea 1: Batch Round 0 kernel launches with descriptor arrays (constraint eval + interaction eval)**\nReplace ~1500 per-AIR kernel launches with 2-4 batched launches using descriptor arrays. Cache interaction DAG structure at keygen. Upload all per-AIR contexts as a single H2D copy.\n- Expected impact: 150-200ms savings on Round 0 at APC 300 (294ms → ~100ms)\n- Probability: High (proven pattern from MLE batch kernels and stacked reduction)\n- Complexity: Complex (new batched CUDA kernels + keygen caching)\n\n**Idea 2: Batch Round 0 constraint eval only (simpler subset of Idea 1)**\nBatch only the zerocheck constraint eval. Interaction eval stays per-AIR.\n- Expected impact: 60-80ms savings on Round 0\n- Probability: High\n- Complexity: Moderate\n\n**Idea 3: Multi-stream MLE Rounds evaluation**\nApply multi-stream parallelism to MLE round evaluations. Distribute batches across threads.\n- Expected impact: 30-50ms savings on MLE Rounds\n- Probability: Low-Medium (inter-round dependencies limit parallelism)\n- Complexity: Moderate\n\n**Idea 4: Per-thread CUDA stream-ordered memory pools**\nReplace global MemoryManager mutex with per-thread stream-ordered pools.\n- Expected impact: 20-40ms across all multi-stream phases\n- Probability: Medium\n- Complexity: Simple-Moderate\n\n**Idea 5: Fuse fill_zero with stack_columns_kernel in Trace Commit**\n- Expected impact: 10-20ms\n- Probability: High\n- Complexity: Simple\n\n**Ranking by (impact × probability / complexity):**\n1. **Idea 1**: (175ms × 0.8) / 3 = 46.7 — Best absolute impact\n2. **Idea 2**: (70ms × 0.85) / 2 = 29.8\n3. **Idea 4**: (30ms × 0.5) / 1.5 = 10.0\n4. **Idea 5**: (15ms × 0.9) / 1 = 13.5\n5. **Idea 3**: (40ms × 0.35) / 2 = 7.0\n\n**Selected: Idea 1** — Batch Round 0 kernel launches with descriptor arrays. This has the highest absolute impact and directly targets the worst-scaling component.\n\nNow let me write the task and plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13293,"cache_read_input_tokens":118604,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13293},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2fb024d-582e-4612-82c1-d7c12af7ab35","uuid":"96a496bc-7b07-4185-873e-1d3f70a33661"}
