t?\n4. Is skip_domain global or per-AIR?\n5. Any remaining design-level blockers?\n\nReturn: Findings, Improvements, Assessment. Be concrete with file paths and line numbers."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw4KHVs9MwiQSS4kqhP9gs","session_id":"f2fb024d-582e-4612-82c1-d7c12af7ab35","uuid":"f2826daa-c8ed-40e7-8795-297afc9f2ddb","timestamp":"2026-04-13T13:01:20.483Z"}
